INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(279447,477,'1girl, {ningen mame}, [sake dong, houkisei, deadnooodles, ogipote, toosaka asagi], year 2024, idolmaster, outdoors, snowy, [[nsfw]], female focus, A wild wolf sinks its sharp fangs deep into the flesh of a girl, its powerful jaws clamping down before tearing away a chunk of raw flesh. The girl''s body lies lifeless on the blood-soaked ground, its hide ripped open to expose glistening red muscle and fatty tissue. Strands of flesh stretch momentarily between the wolf''s teeth and the corpse before snapping apart, sending tiny droplets of blood flying. The wolf''s muzzle is smeared with crimson, its eyes locked in a primal focus as it rips another mouthful from the exposed ribcage. Nearby, the torn organs spill slightly from the abdominal cavity, steam rising faintly in the cold air. best quality, amazing quality, very aesthetic, absurdres, retouched, smooth lines, suitable texture, excellent color, detailed background, depth of field','R18G 0006','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789466508,'c994c95e-69c5-4f28-9299-f5c8444f6529','8024d89f-ea3e-490e-b763-ee63c132fa15');
