1.5::dappled sunlight filtering through leaves, god rays, brilliant azure sky, cumulus clouds ::, 1.3::high saturation teal and cyan color palette, summer heat shimmer, lens flare ::, 1.2::Studio Ghibli background style, Makoto Shinkai lighting, scenic background art ::, 0.7::melancholic atmosphere, post-apocalyptic slice of life ::

A serene post-apocalyptic scene where nature reclaims a flooded Japanese neighborhood. The water is impossibly clear and blue, reflecting the eternal summer sky. Old architecture stands resilient amidst the gentle flood, with vines cascading from balconies. The lighting suggests endless afternoon, around 2 PM on the hottest day of August.



, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','常规 0452','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789466969,'387c8839-a4ae-444b-841c-92fa51e99b6c','365e48bc-3c66-48e3-bf48-6d6d8d579792');
