INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(281730,541,'0.6::artist:miv4t::,artist:potg (piotegu),artist:wlop,1.5::artist:huang gua::,1.2::artist:rei (sanbonzakura)::,2::{artist:mento}::,0.5::artist:shion(mirudakemann)::,1.5::artist:sincos::,0.8::artist:ciloranko::,2::1 girl::,solo,masterpiece,best quality,full body,from side,looking away,{{wide shot,landscape}},cinematic angle,aerial,A girl stands at the edge of a cliff on a battlefield, her hair cascading like the night sky, dotted with faint starlight highlights. She wears a dark purple wizard robe embroidered with intricate star patterns that appear mysterious and profound under the moonlight. Her hands are gently clasped at her chest, fingertips surrounded by a purple aura. The air around her seems distorted, filled with an enigmatic energy. She chants an ancient spell, her voice soft and ethereal like a night breeze. As she chants, the sky suddenly turns pitch black, and countless stars fall from the heavens, transforming into a dazzling meteor shower that strikes the enemy. The battlefield becomes a sea of starlight. The girl''s expression is calm and profound, her figure both holy and distant against the backdrop of the stars, as if she wields the power of the cosmos itself., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','常规 2277','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789468791,'4c7cd364-a34c-41de-ae3f-f14f8bba2134','365e48bc-3c66-48e3-bf48-6d6d8d579792');
